---
title: "initialize (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: validate params
    q_validate --> q_check_refund: params valid
    q_validate --> q_revert_params: invalid parameters
    q_check_refund --> q_check_addresses: refundPeriodSeconds in [1 hour, 2 weeks]
    q_check_refund --> q_revert_refund: invalid refund period
    q_check_addresses --> q_check_fees: bidToken, projectAdmin, addressRegistry valid
    q_check_addresses --> q_revert_addr: invalid addresses
    q_check_fees --> q_set_config: fee basis points valid
    q_check_fees --> q_revert_fees: invalid fees
    q_set_config --> q_init_state: set refundPeriodSeconds, fees, addresses, minimumInvestAmount
    q_init_state --> q_emit: hasEnded = false, isCanceled = false
    q_emit --> [*]: emit Initialized
    q_revert_params --> [*]: revert InvalidParameters
    q_revert_refund --> [*]: revert InvalidRefundPeriod
    q_revert_addr --> [*]: revert InvalidAddress
    q_revert_fees --> [*]: revert InvalidFeeConfiguration

    note right of q_set_config
        INV-001: no predetermined endTime (asynchronous open application)
        INV-002: askToken not set until publishSaleResults
        INV-003: minimumInvestAmount enforced per deposit
    end note
